OL,3,GNEWSABus services set to change after
OL,4,Acountywide review
OL,5,
OL,6,FA number of bus services are set to be
OL,7,Fchanged following a review of the
OL,8,Fcounty's network.
OL,10,FCambridgeshire & Peterborough Combined
OL,11,FAuthority wanted to ensure
OL,12,Fpublicly-funded investments in bus
OL,13,Fservices were "giving the best return"
OL,14,Fas part of its plans for franchising.
OL,16,FIf approved, the changes will be
OL,17,Fbrought in from February.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
